kind":"announcement","title":"Greyvale Rivarly Demo is out!","summary":"Hey everyone, If you follow our status updates, you might know we'll be joining the October Next Fest, so we've released our demo! It has a quite decent length that is well over an hour! If you're unfamiliar with the game, this demo will set the game's tone for you clearly.So, what does the demo have? 14 language options! Over 1000 renders! A really hot H scene with SFX! A bunch of Licensed soundtracks and Cinematics! Previews:We're still working on the game, but we'd love for you to check out t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T18:52:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934405","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1846018067924743","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Episode 2 - Status Update #6","summary":"Hello everyone,It's been a while since our last update! Let's talk about what we've been up to over the last month.First off, we put together a demo for Steam because we wanted to join the October Steam Next Fest! To be honest, dealing with the phone code during this prep was a headache. It just wouldn't work right with the translations. We had to do a massive code cleanup, but we finally got it into a solid spot. The good news is that adding translations for future releases will be a breeze fro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T01:55:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067924743","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1842846814451810","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Episode 2 - Status Update #5","summary":"Hello everyone,It's been a while since our last update! To be honest, the burnout from the previous status continued. Because of that, we took a one week break to rest and clear our heads. We are feeling much better now!When we came back from our break, we looked closely at how we work. We realized that jumping straight from the script to 3D renders was slowing us down and wasting a lot of time.To fix this, we spent about a week and a half changing our process. We decided to focus a lot more on ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T23:18:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451810","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1837955055362022","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Episode 2 - Status Update #4","summary":"Hello everyone,We're back with another quick update! So, what have we been up to lately? The past two weeks have been heavily focused on animations. We also started working on a brand new scene a few days ago. Once we get that to a certain point, we'll be jumping right back into rendering more animations. To be completely honest, we were feeling a bit burnt out over the last couple of weeks, which naturally caused our productivity to drop. But don't worry, we're feeling much better now and are w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T23:40:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055362022","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1835871199316645","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Episode 2 - Status Update #3","summary":"Hello everyone,We're here with another status update. This one will be short and sweet. So, what's going on, and why haven't we posted an update for a month?As you know, we also develop The Grey Dream, and we were getting used to the new work schedule, but that doesn't mean we didn't make any progress. We were mostly focusing on the animations for Greyvale Rivalry, since rendering them didn't require any active work while they were being rendered. About two weeks ago, we finally figured out how ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-23T20:19:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199316645","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1830797770243743","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Episode 2 - Status Update #2","summary":"Hello everyone,We're back with another status update. Let me be real with you—it's been a painfully annoying couple of weeks. Not gonna lie, these last three weeks were absolute hell because our rigs just kept crashing every single time we tried to render the statics we'd posed. It got so bad that at one point, we had three weeks' worth of posed scenes just sitting in the queue because the hardware stubbornly refused to spit out more than 10 renders a day.But! We finally found a fix for it a cou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-27T22:27:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770243743","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1828894815568197","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Episode 2 - Status Update #1","summary":"Hello everyone,Yeah, we know. It's been a hot minute since we last dropped a Steam post, and we are genuinely sorry for the radio silence. But trust us, we haven't just been sitting on our hands—we've been grinding non-stop, and we've come a very long way.Last time we gave you guys an update, we were sitting at around 3,000 renders. Well, Episode 1 ended up being a massive 5,200 renders. On top of the static stuff, we also cranked out 90+ animations, which basically ate up almost two entire mont","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-07T18:53:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815568197","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1808601382559925","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Status Update #10","summary":"Hello everyone,We're back with the sixth Greyvale Rivalry status update. The last two weeks were pretty chill, except for the couple of days we spent working on the wallpaper DLC of The Grey Dream. We spent a couple of days on that, but the rest of the time was really productive. With these two weeks, we've reached a total of 3,000 renders. We finished a scene and started working on a new one. You might be wondering why we jumped from the 12th to the 14th scene in the rendering process. We wante","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-25T01:09:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1808601382559925","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1801617199362053","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Status Update #8","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45438919/60c88c0e17a423f37df9efcb82cae084c68d3968.png Hello everyone, After a long break, we're back with another Greyvale Rivalry status update. If you regularly read our status updates, you may know that we took a break from Greyvale to speed up the animation rendering process for The Grey Dream. Since then, we have achieved a lot, and we have also grown tired of working on the same scenes for a couple of weeks. So, last week, we resumed the development cycle of Greyvale to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-04T15:06:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1801617199362053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1797185861809474","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Status Update #7","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45438919/217f05bc48810d0738dadebae31eaa6189dbcfce.png Hello everyone, We're back with another update. This week we don't have multiple scenes to talk about as we were busy with scene 8. Before we get to the scene talk, let's take a look at what we've been up to over the past week. We've been looking for music and SFX, as well as working on the menu design. We have a general idea of what we want the menu to look like and we're making progress. Some people have messaged us askin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-22T20:37:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1797185861809474","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1795917897464494","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Status Update #6","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45438919/51dd5fbc6a337420060a4a33dbd1396a66727cf7.png Hello everyone, We wanted to post this update yesterday but we were out of town for the day so sorry for the delay. We also took a few days off last week. After the break we started working on the eighth scene this week. From the looks of it, we're 90% sure that this will end up being one of our favourite scenes. It's also on the longer side in terms of dialogue. If everything goes as planned, we should be able to finish th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-07T21:13:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795917897464494","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1794830911045349","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Status Update #5","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45438919/0f783ffe13afc112cc7dad777703282074afe617.png Hello everyone, we're back with another status update. The last two weeks haven't been the most efficient. We've mostly been busy with IRL stuff, but we've still made some progress. Most importantly, we've finally gotten back to work on the second scene and started on the seventh. Let's have a look at the new numbers. Second scene: By far the biggest part of the scene. It was completely written when we started working on it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-25T21:43:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794830911045349","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1793384379479514","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Status Update #4","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45438919/9ca8fad840bd6d4a812b3cda0adf0ff77dfbf6ff.png Hello everyone, We're back with another status update. Let's start with the total number of renders. As of today we've reached 1500 static renders. We would like to have less of them, but the scenes were too dynamic and we didn't want to cut them short, so the first six scenes ended up with this many renders. Besides the renders, we've also rendered the first animation of the game. It's about 360 and it crashed a couple of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-09T20:45:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1793384379479514","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1792116353300682","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Status Update #3","summary":"Hello everyone, We are back with the third status update. The last two weeks have been pretty cool. Strangely enough, we had no problems or anyone got sick or anything. Let's just get to the scenes since we have nothing else to talk about this week. Fourth scene: It's finally done. It ended up being 218 renders. We're thinking about changing some dialogue here and there, but overall we're done with this one. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45438919/49a1edca92c92ff78aaf62c3d8d17ad6dfcb4c60.png Fifth scene: Th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-02-23T20:24:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1792116353300682","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3426460-1790848102756698","game_id":"steam-3426460","kind":"update","title":"Greyvale Rivalry - Status Update #2","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45438919/77d815fdaeb54380b55158a4d4ff350057c204f1.png Hello everyone, It's been over a month since the first status update, so it was about time for a second one. We've been busy with the release of our other game and the development of its next chapter, so we couldn't really focus on the Greyvale Rivalry until the beginning of February. But now that we've started, we thought it was time to let you know what's going on. Before we get to the scene-by-scene progress updates, we ","occurred_a